# Ingenious Prodigy cast for X = 0 ({U}) enters with no counters, a 0/1 (CR 107.3, 614.1c), so its upkeep ability's intervening "if"
# (CR 603.4) is false: nothing goes on the stack at the beginning of Bot1's upkeep, so Bot1 draws only its turn's card.
# The positive control is ingenious-prodigy-enters-with-x-counters-and-draws-for-each-one-removed-at-upkeep.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ingenious Prodigy
Island x4
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ingenious Prodigy.Cast(X: 0)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ingenious Prodigy.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Ingenious Prodigy.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ingenious Prodigy.Toughness = 1
